WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
We shoot here. Vertical. Like a customer filmed it.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
Deploy more agents. A hundred takes before lunch.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
It has to look fogged. We can reason about that part.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Do we really need one shaking it and one splashing it?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
We need the reviews too. A hundred happy customers, standing by.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Hold on. Every review is citing another review. There is no original.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Excuse me. I actually use this. Can I be in it?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Sorry. You read as fake. The clone tested better.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The real one got cut. That is the part I cannot process.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
One real user here. The other ninety-nine ran on our own machines, and none of them left the building.

